  m_text: As Sam and Spot were going back home, Sam felt happy knowing he had made
    someone smile. When they got home, Sam's mom praised him for his generosity and
    tucked him into bed. With his dog curled up at his feet, Sam drifted off to sleep,
    feeling proud of his good deed.
