  m_text: The teacher pointed to the world map hanging on the wall, explaining each
    country. With a pep in her step, Sarah raced to the front of the class to collect
    her gold star. Meanwhile, Lavesh accidentally bit his lip while chewing on his
    pencil. During break time, the helper used the mop to clean the hallway floor.
    Outside, a cop directed traffic with precise hand gestures. In the cafeteria,
    Riya sipped her juice from a colourful cup, while her pup, Bugsy, took a nap.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
