  m_text: '       a long day at school, Sarah decided to go to the park to     her
    kite. She was enjoying the moment.     she tried to take the kite higher, it
    got stuck in a tree branch. "Oh oh! There is a baby bird     the kite string,"
    said Sarah. She saw the bird''s beak was almost trapped. She tried to pull the
    string       . The bird struggled. She        try to pull the string gently,
    but Sarah didn''t want to take      chances.'
